---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { record } from "../config/site";
---

<Base
  title="Practice"
  description="Jonas Eicher’s independent Munich practice: background since 2017, a pragmatic way of working, and a network of external experts."
>
  <header class="page-intro">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="section-label">Practice</p>
      <h1>An independent practice with a long working record.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Jonas Eicher is a physicist and software engineer based in Munich. The
        freelance practice has been the main vehicle for client work since 2017:
        full-stack engineering, DevOps consulting, product ownership, and Scrum.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="wrap prose">
    <p class="section-label">Record</p>
    <ol class="record">
      {
        record.map((item) => (
          <li>
            <span class="period">{item.period}</span>
            <div>
              <h2>{item.title}</h2>
              <p>{item.detail}</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap prose">
    <p class="section-label">How the work is run</p>
    <h2>Pragmatic teams, not a method for its own sake.</h2>
    <ul class="principles">
      <li>
        Small, skilled teams, with room for people to act without waiting to be
        assigned.
      </li>
      <li>
        Knowledge moves because someone knows it and shares it, not because a
        ritual extracts it.
      </li>
      <li>
        Transparency is used where it gives direction and builds trust between
        the team and the people using the product.
      </li>
      <li>
        Whoever can solve a problem does. Whoever knows a better way says so.
      </li>
      <li>
        Agile delivery is a balance of discipline and freedom, initiative and
        outside dependency, structure and room. Hold that balance and the work
        gets simpler.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap section">
      <p class="section-label">Expert network</p>
      <p>
        The practice is independent, and it is not a one-person ceiling. A broad
        field of external experts is available when a project is larger or wider
        than a single discipline: additional engineers, designers,
        infrastructure specialists, and people who know the client’s domain.
        They are brought in for the engagement. The client still has one
        accountable contact.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
